{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Context a store keeps","anchor":"Context-a-store-keeps","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidSampleRate","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ScreenKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ApplicationKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeviceKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/OperatingSystemKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/LocaleKey","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/NetworkKey"]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/InstrumentationContextKey-Implementations"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SessionKey.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24"},"externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"title":"SessionKey","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a new identifier.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SegmentStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": once its whole segment","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the one identifier in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps it apart from a record.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"p